ana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><b>Warsztaty: Anna Ka\u0142uszka<\/b> | Mi\u0119dzy ksi\u0105\u017ck\u0105, a plansz\u0105 \u2013 tw\u00f3rcze gry wyobra\u017ani<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; text-align: justify;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Wraz z <b>Ann\u0105 Ka\u0142uszk\u0105<\/b> uczestnicy zaprojektuj\u0105 w\u0142asne gry planszowe inspirowane ulubionymi ksi\u0105\u017ckami. Punktem wyj\u015bcia b\u0119d\u0105 znane historie, kt\u00f3re dzieci przek\u0142adaj\u0105 na zasady gry, plansz\u0119 i mechanik\u0119 rozgrywki. Zaj\u0119cia rozwijaj\u0105 kreatywno\u015b\u0107, umiej\u0119tno\u015b\u0107 wsp\u00f3\u0142pracy oraz my\u015blenie narracyjne, a tak\u017ce wzmacniaj\u0105 motywacj\u0119 do czytania<\/span><\/font><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">.<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; text-align: justify;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: nor