{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-11 10:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-15 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-11 11:00:00"},"products":[{"id":172,"name":"Spotkanie autorskie ","rawPrice":500,"price":"5,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":16}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":3242,"name":"BECEK CZYTA \u2013 Spotkanie autorskie: Robb Maci\u0105g ","description":"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><b>11.10<\/b><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><b>niedziela<\/b><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><b>11.00<\/b><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><b>Spotkanie autorskie: Robb Maci\u0105g<\/b> |  Plansz\u00f3wki \u015bwiata, czyli jak zosta\u0107 odkrywc\u0105?<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; text-align: justify;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Ruszamy w fascynuj\u0105c\u0105 podr\u00f3\u017c, a naszym przewodnikiem b\u0119dzie posta\u0107 absolutnie wyj\u0105tkowa \u2013 <b>Robb Maci\u0105g<\/b>! To ceniony podr\u00f3\u017cnik, kt\u00f3ry na dw\u00f3ch k\u00f3\u0142kach przemierzy\u0142 najodleglejsze kra\u0144ce Azji, a tak\u017ce autor fantastycznych i nagradzanych ksi\u0105\u017cek dla dzieci. To on napisa\u0142 porywaj\u0105c\u0105 \u201eKsi\u0105\u017ck\u0119 o g\u00f3rach\u201d oraz pe\u0142n\u0105 humoru i przyg\u00f3d \u201eWielk\u0105 Ucieczk\u0119 Wawelskiego Smoka\u201d (w kt\u00f3rej s\u0142ynny potw\u00f3r zamiast zgin\u0105\u0107, ucieka przez Turcj\u0119 i Persj\u0119 a\u017c do Chin!). Podczas tego wyj\u0105tkowego spotkania Robb otworzy przed nami skrzyni\u0119 pe\u0142n\u0105 niezwyk\u0142ych opowie\u015bci oraz... tradycyjnych, etnicznych gier planszowych z ca\u0142ego \u015bwiata<\/span><\/font><span style=\"text-align: justify; font-size: 13.3333px;\">.<\/span><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; text-align: justify;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; text-align: justify;\"><font face=\"Arial, Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><b>Czas trwania:<\/b> 80 min | <b>Miejsce:<\/b> Lokal w Bytomiu, plac Jana III Sobieskiego 3 | <b>Wiek:<\/b> 6+ | <b>Bilety:<\/b> 5 z\u0142<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Verdana; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; text-align: justify;\"><font